<title>JAPAN: Kinki Nippon Railway to issue two sets of bonds.</title>
<headline>Kinki Nippon Railway to issue two sets of bonds.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kinki Nippon Railway Co Ltd said on Friday it has decided to issue two legs of domestic straight bonds. Details of the terms are as follows:</p>
<p>LEAD MGR - Nomura Securities</p>
<p>TRUSTEE - Bank of Tokyo-Mitsubishi</p>
<p> TYPE  straight bond  ISSUE NO  19	  AMT   20 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON  not decided  ISS PRICE par	 MATURITY 25.Jan.02</p>
<p> LAST MOODY'S	   PAY DATE 31.Jan.97  INT PAY</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P		 SIGN DATE	     SUB DATE 28.Jan.97</p>
<p> LAST JCR		 LAST JBRI  AA	 LAST NIS</p>
<p> LEAD MGR - Nomura Securities</p>
<p> TRUSTEE - Bank of Tokyo-Mitsubishi</p>
<p> TYPE  straight bond  ISSUE NO  20	  AMT   20 bln yen</p>
<p> COUPON  not decided  ISS PRICE par	 MATURITY 23.Feb.01</p>
<p> PAY DATE 14.March.97 INT PAY</p>
<p> SIGN DATE		SUB DATE 24.Feb-13.March</p>
<p> LAST MOODY'S	   LAST S&amp;P		  LAST JCR</p>
<p> LAST JBRI  AA	  LAST NIS</p>
<p>NOTE: The second set of bonds will be issued for individual investors.</p>
</text>
